@startuml
' Successful standalone save, followed by the next command prompt.
hide footbox

actor User
participant ":BusyNotFree" as App
participant ":DataStorage" as Storage
participant ":Ui" as UI

User -> App : save
activate App
note over App : run() has recognised save\nand checked that it has no arguments.
App -> App : saveData()
activate App
App -> Storage : save(clients, projects)
activate Storage
note over App, Storage
  The SaveAction callback delegates this call.
  Its invocation is omitted for clarity.
end note
note right of Storage
  Collect records, completion flags
  and next-ID counters.
  Write a temporary UTF-8 file,
  then replace the data file.
end note
Storage --> App
deactivate Storage
App --> App : true
deactivate App
App -> UI : showDataSaved()
activate UI
UI --> App
deactivate UI
App -> UI : showPrompt()
activate UI
UI --> App
deactivate UI
deactivate App

@enduml
